    "sections": {
        "description": "The Titan Event Management Theme provides a structured website layout for presenting event information in a clear and organized format. It includes responsive design elements that adapt across desktop and mobile devices, helping maintain a consistent browsing experience. Homepage sections can display banners, schedules, galleries, testimonials, venue details, and contact information. The layout also supports content for event planners, wedding planners, corporate event planners, and conference organizers by allowing information to be arranged in dedicated sections without requiring major structural changes. Customization options include adjustable colors, typography, headers, footers, and page layouts to match different branding requirements. The theme supports image galleries, inquiry forms, maps, social media links, and newsletter subscription areas. Additional sections can be used for service details, speaker profiles, pricing, FAQs, and announcements. It is also suitable for organizing content related to wedding organizers, seminar organizers, exhibition organizers, and event management companies through flexible page structures. Clean code, straightforward navigation, and compatibility with commonly used page- building tools contribute to an organized website that is easy to maintain and update over time."
    },
